      ],
      "content": "TL 11 SW                   REDBOURN             CHURCH END (south side) REDBOURN COMMON 5/149                                           No 46 9.8.74 GV                                              II House.  Early-mid C19.  Red brick.  Slate roof.  2 storeys.   1 1st floor sash window in a moulded flush frame.  Ground floor has a flush panel door with a gauged brick lintel and a late C19 canted sash bay window.  Left end elevation is stepped back at rear.  Included for group value. Listing NGR: TL1011711644"
    }
